@startuml UC5_ManageTeam_UseCase
title UC5 - Manage Pokemon Team (Use Case Diagram)
note "**Under Development**\nNo dedicated TeamScreen exists.\nTeam management is handled inline\nvia CatchService and BattleScreen." as N1
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Team Management System" {
  (View PokemonTeam)
  (CatchService adds Pokemon)
  (BattleScreen switch Pokemon)
  (StoryService heals team)
}

Player --> (View PokemonTeam)
(View PokemonTeam) --> Player

Player --> (CatchService adds Pokemon) : via catch in battle
(CatchService adds Pokemon) --> Player

Player --> (BattleScreen switch Pokemon) : during battle
(BattleScreen switch Pokemon) --> Player

Player --> (StoryService heals team) : at Pokemon Center
(StoryService heals team) --> Player

note right of (View PokemonTeam)
  Planned features:
  - Swap positions
  - Release Pokemon
  - Box management
end note

@enduml
